              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.7.5+1SA.7.6+1SA.7.7+1SA.7.8+1SA.7.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 7.5-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naaitoki Olaitoriani ajoki nanu, “Ore naaji ninye teneitashe Musa o Samuel te dukuya nanu, meibelekenya oltau lai aing'or kulo tung'ana. Taarai ninche meshomo too nkonyek aainei, naa nchoo ninche meshomo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 13.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore ake pee kinkilikuan ninche iyie, aajoki, ‘Kaji iyiook kipuo?’ Nijoki iyie ninche, Nji ejo Olaitoriani:”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kagelaki nanu shumata ninche mpukunot ong'uan oo looidaikie, Olaitoriani ojo: olalem oar, ildien oopolos, olmotonyi lo loing'ang'e o ng'uesi enkop pee emut ninche aaidaikie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.1+2KI.21.2+2KI.21.3+2KI.21.4+2KI.21.5+2KI.21.6+2KI.21.7+2KI.21.8+2KI.21.9+2KI.21.10+2KI.21.11+2KI.21.12+2KI.21.13+2KI.21.14+2KI.21.15+2KI.21.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ilai 21.1-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.33.1+2CH.33.2+2CH.33.3+2CH.33.4+2CH.33.5+2CH.33.6+2CH.33.7+2CH.33.8+2CH.33.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 33.1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naa kaitaa nanu ninche entoki naitureisho too nkitoriat pooki enkop tenkaraki ina nataasa Manase olayioni le Hesekia, olaiguanani le Yuda tiatua Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eing'unyung'unyaka Yeremia Olaitoriani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woi nanu, yieyio lai, amu kitoiwuo nanu, oltung'ani o ekenya okeshare enkop pooki, neitu aisilenisho, kake aadekita ninche pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa nchoo etiu neijia, Olaitoriani, teneitu nanu aaisiaai aitobiraki teneitu nanu aasai iyie terishata oo lmang'ati laainei etii ninche atua enyamali o sina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ketii obo oidim atigila esekenkei naing'uaa moikuape o suyai?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore karsisisho ino o lchumati lino naa kaisho metarari, metii enkinyang'a, tenkaraki ing'ok inono pooki, tiatua enkop ino pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaaisho nanu iyie isiaayia ilmang'ati linono tiatua enkop nimiyiolo, amu ore te engoro ai neinuaaki enkima nayupuyup ntarasi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olaitoriani iyiolo iyie; tadamuaki nanu nikimutan nanu, nintalaku elap tiaalo nanu too laisilisilok laainei. Ore te ng'iriata ino mikiya nanu; tayiolo ajo tenkaraki iyie pee anap imorot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enotoki rorei linono, nanya nanu ninche, neaku irorei linono te nanu eng'ida o enchipai oltau lai; amu te nkarna ino aaipotoki nanu, Olaitoriani, Enkai oo lororani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eitu nanu aton to lturrur loo looshipa, ang'ida; atotona nanu openy, amu etii apa enkaina ino shumata nanu, amu kimputa nanu engoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kainyoo pee meish emion ai. Nemeishiunoyu olbae lai ketanya eishiunyeki? Itiu iyie te nanu anaa ereyiet nalejisho, anaa nkariak naaishiunye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku nji ejo Olaitoriani: “Tenishukunye, naang'amu nanu, naa intashe iyie te dukuya nanu. Teniro iyie ina sidai, neme ina nara pesho, nitiu iyie anaa enkutuk ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kaaitaa nanu iyie te kulo tung'ana esuntai nasheta osuyai; nikiarare ninche iyie, kake mikimir ninche iyie, Olaitoriani ojo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaakordu nanu iyie aitung'uaa enkaina eilo torrono, naalaku iyie aitung'uaa enkibung'ata eilo lemeeta olng'ur.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
